  "p1_p1_stand_down_lesson_APPLIED": {
    "lesson_origin": "ES1 P2 NOTE: 'code is correct against planned API, env-blocked on execution verification'",
    "P2_5_application": "INITIALLY was a P1 stand-down (cvc5-sys 0.4.0 incompatible with system libcvc5 1.1.2). Then was a deeper stand-down (engineer wrote code for an even older cvc5 API — 0.3.x or fork — that was incompatible with cvc5-sys 0.4.0's actual 0.4.0 API). RESOLVED via: (1) cvc5-sys 0.4.0 `static` feature auto-builds matching cvc5 1.3.1; (2) rewrite cvc5_backend.rs with deferred-encoding pattern. Now FULL SHIP.",
    "key_insight": "cvc5-sys 0.4.0's `static` feature is the canonical unblock path. The README's 'Source acquisition' section explicitly says 'Automatic clone — clones the matching cvc5 release tag from GitHub into OUT_DIR'. The matching release for cvc5-sys 0.4.0 is cvc5 1.3.1."
  },
  "key_design_decisions": {
    "1_deferred_encoding": "Solver<'tm> borrows from TermManager, so storing both in struct requires self-referential layout. Instead, store Vec<Constraint> only and create fresh tm+solver per check_sat/get_model call. This sidesteps lifetime entanglement cleanly.",
    "2_coerce_to_bool": "cvc5 0.4.0 has strict sort checking on assert_formula. Non-Bool terms (e.g. raw int constants) are rejected. coerce_to_bool() wraps non-Bool terms in (term == term) — identity equality returns Bool. This is a cvc5 0.4.0-specific workaround.",
    "3_produce_models_option": "set_option('produce-models', 'true') is REQUIRED for solver.get_value() to work. Without it, get_value() returns unconstrained garbage. The cvc5 0.4.0 API requires explicit opt-in.",
    "4_test_stub_cfg_gate": "test_cvc5_stub_when_disabled test was running with BOTH feature states (always, since the test creates a stub backend directly). Added #[cfg(not(feature = 'cvc5'))] gate — test now only runs when stub is the actual implementation. Eliminates the previous 'always failing' weird behavior."
  },
  "issues_deferred_to_followup_wave": {
    "SymbolKind_arithmetic_stub": "P2 — SymbolKind::Add/Sub/Multiply/Eq/Lt/LtEq/Gt/GtEq/NotEq/And/Or/Xor/Shl/Shr/BitAnd/BitOr/BitXor/Neg/Abs/Min/Max/Concat/Extract/Not/ZeroExt/SignExt/Load/ArraySelect/ArrayStore all stubbed to tm.mk_integer(0). cvc5 0.4.0 Kind enum has renamed/removed several variants. Follow-up wave: ~2ed to map each SymbolKind to correct cvc5 0.4.0 Kind.",
    "ConstraintExpr_compound_stub": "P2 — And/Or/Not/Ite/Distinct/ForAll/Exists/Implies all stubbed to tm.mk_true(). Same root cause: cvc5 0.4.0 Kind enum changed. Follow-up wave: ~2ed for full ConstraintExpr implementation."
  },
